    "npcKind": "monster",
    "npcNotes": "<p><strong>Movement:</strong> 6 yards, swim 8 yards</p><p><strong>Camouflage.</strong> +2D on Stealth tests in forests.</p><p><strong>Lore.</strong> A long, slender, two-legged forest serpent that preys on deer; man-eaters may stalk frontier villages.</p><p><em>Statistics: Agility 3 (Contortions 1B, Quickness 1B), Athletics 4 (Strength 2B, Swim 4B), Awareness 3 (Notice 2B), Cunning 1, Endurance 4, Fighting 3, Stealth 3, Survival 3. Sword Chronicle p. 189.</em></p>",
    "source": "Sword Chronicle p. 189"
